what  to u mean by for..of loop in the js ??
for (const num of numbers)
👉 This means:

“Take each value from the array one by one”

So instead of using index (i), you directly get values:

Iteration	num
1	        1
2	        2
3	        3
4	        4

🚀 Clean mental model
for...of → get values
if(condition) → stop (break)
else → store


